Jer 16:1 , The prophet, under the types of abstaining from marriage, from houses of mourning and feasting, foreshews the utter ruin of the Jews;
Jer 16:10 , because they were worse than their fathers;
Jer 16:14 , Their return from captivity shall be stranger than their deliverance out of Egypt;
Jer 16:16 , God will doubly recompense their idolatry.
